@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280

title Clinical trial detail — a VIEW / MEMBER of the clinicalTrial page, NOT a page\nHow one trial opens today: the React widget paints it from the search result it already cached.\nNo tool, no route, no live freshness on open — EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 is the gap.

actor "Person" as P
participant "clinicalTrial page\n(React client widget)" as PAGE
database "cached search result\n(client memory)" as CACHE
participant "Gate\n(facade, transport only)" as GATE
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices)" as UN
participant "UniversalNavigatorProxy\n(FindCare)" as PXY
participant "ClinicalTrials\n(tool, the page's required member)" as CT
participant "ClinicalTrials.gov\n(external registry, not ours)" as CTG

== Context: the clinicalTrial page's one required member already ran (Geo resolves any location) ==
P -> PAGE : type a condition (and, if given, a place) and search
PAGE -> GATE : navigate(session_token, head, params) — a client_sessioned call
GATE -> UN : pass(session_token, head, params)
UN -> PXY : dispatch ClinicalTrials across the wire (tool_to_tool)\n(required member of the clinicalTrial page)
PXY -> CT : relay locally (function call)
CT -> CTG : query trials by condition / location
CTG --> CT : the matching trials, as full records
CT --> PXY : trial-list document
note over CT
  The ClinicalTrials tool's output document carries a UserRefinementRequestText field.
  Empty here — the tool is ANSWERING with trials, not asking the user anything.
  Populated would mean the tool is ASKING a question, delivered to the user only
  through the UtteranceManager's RequestUsersRefinement(question). No tool talks
  to the user directly.
end note
PXY --> UN : internal_callback (proof: our_signature) — closes the ledger entry
UN --> GATE : the reconciled clinicalTrial page (the gate writes the one stream)
GATE --> PAGE : the trial list
PAGE -> CACHE : cache the returned trials, each a full record
note over CACHE
  The search result carries the FULL trial record for every hit.
  There is no second fetch for a single trial — which is exactly
  why the detail below needs no server round-trip today.
end note

== Today: opening one trial is a client-side paint — no server round-trip ==
P -> PAGE : click a trial's link (a gesture, not an utterance)\nopenNctId names which trial is on screen
PAGE -> CACHE : read the already-cached trial by NCT id
CACHE --> PAGE : the trial record (from the earlier search)
PAGE -> PAGE : lay the trial into its section anchors\n+ the right-panel section list that jumps between them\n(recursion-guarded; EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 display)
PAGE --> P : the trial in its sections
note right of PAGE
  No Gate call, no UniversalNavigator, no render ledger, no tool,
  no route. openNctId is declared and the page records which trial
  is on screen, but NOTHING server-side serves a trial detail.
end note

note over GATE, CTG #fde68a
  THE GAP — EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 is unbuilt.
  Its two siblings ARE built tools that reconcile a page on open:
    - provider_detail  -> live NPPES query by NPI, then reconcile
    - facility_detail  -> live registry query by NPI, then reconcile
  Trial detail has NEITHER a tool NOR a route. It never re-queries
  ClinicalTrials.gov for the single trial, so it cannot be brought
  to live freshness the way a provider or facility detail is; it can
  only re-show what the search already returned.
  mig_after proposes a new member trial_detail (tool + route) that
  would open on the same page-construction terms as its siblings:
    Gate -> UN -> render ledger -> UniversalNavigatorProxy ->
    trial_detail -> ClinicalTrials.gov, reconciled against
    required_members = { trial_detail }, with on_timeout /
    on_conflict / on_missing_required instrumented by impact.
end note

@enduml
